This run works from the repository owner's rulings on the decisions the runs on this pull request left for them. Each ruling is quoted below as it was given: it is the text the run that answered those decisions was launched with, not a review instruction, and what each settles is the decisions listed under it and nothing else. The first is the ruling this run works from; the ones after it answered decisions that are settled just as firmly, and they are here so that a question the owner has already answered is not put to them again.

<<<fugaro-owner-ruling-0123456789abcdef>>>
