It answers these decisions, which the run before it left waiting:

    `LICENSE.md`: the licence text needs counsel's clearance
    `internal/approval/flow.go`: the approval flow is a product decision

A finding that is one of the decisions above is answered by the ruling it is listed under: report it only if the change contradicts the answer, and never mark it needs_owner. Any other finding is reported as any finding is, and a new question only the owner can settle is still needs_owner, which is how the owner is asked about it.
